{"game": "space-marine-2", "language": "english", "appid": 2183900, "month": "2024-10", "window": 1, "start_date": 1727740800, "end_date": 1728345599, "month_true_total": 11766, "quota": 36, "returned": 36, "pulled_at": "2026-09-11 02:20:54 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "176595233", "author": {"steamid": "76561198111385559", "personaname": "Vip3rr600", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198111385559/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 1982, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1077, "last_played": 1762831115, "avatar": "9db4379c2531f5accd95570c7ac358f7169393dc"}, "language": "english", "review": " game", "timestamp_created": 1728344953, "timestamp_updated": 1728344953, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "176595229", "author": {"steamid": "76561198082928668", "personaname": "Quigmman the Turkey Vulture", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/realturkeyinc/", "num_games_owned": 903, "num_reviews": 274, "playtime_forever": 8328, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5098, "last_played": 1772263246, "avatar": "5b31c1a7868e9b6f870598e8da354a2d39ef6310"}, "language": "english", "review": "Hoooooly hell the wait was worth it. It's just Space Marine 1 but improved. Gameplay, Enviroments, Core Mechanics, everything! I need more - I wish to serve the Emperor eternally.\n\n\n\n\nServe the Emperor", "timestamp_created": 1728344945, "timestamp_updated": 1732749140, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "176595209", "author": {"steamid": "76561198258604164", "personaname": "Wreaky", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/killzone44441/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 914, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 536, "last_played": 1733237579, "avatar": "5b3bbf714664266ce909f32bd1dd439da65cbd13"}, "language": "english", "review": "Long live the Emporor", "timestamp_created": 1728344915, "timestamp_updated": 1728344915, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "176595206", "author": {"steamid": "76561197972842504", "personaname": "Nate", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/NateZorblack/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 3397, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2159, "last_played": 1762551030, "avatar": "b205de338fcaee843140b4c8f9d5929283a909b1"}, "language": "english", "review": "As cool as the story may be, it is still at its core a 12 hour experience at most if you take your time going through. After that, it's operations time. Prepare to experience terrible matchmaking, frustrating UI and design choices with regards to joining friends, frequent crashes, and an insane difficulty spike that you have to overcome without any new tools because you *unlock the tools by beating the higher difficulty.* I wanted to love this game so badly. For 12 hours, I DID love this game. Then Operations limited my choices in armaments and presented nothing but the same 6 missions on repeat with vague promises that \"There will be more, we promise!\" To me, it wasn't worth the price, and I regret buying the gold edition because I don't really trust that there will be enough content to justify playing the game anymore. I'm just deeply, deeply disappointed.", "timestamp_created": 1728344913, "timestamp_updated": 1728344913, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "176595198", "author": {"steamid": "76561198040912092", "personaname": "Inigo Montoya", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198040912092/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 9685, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 794, "deck_playtime_at_review": 794, "last_played": 1751074205, "avatar": "3d8474d2a8bc4e54cd8ea30996a6d3e61bc04c34"}, "language": "english", "review": "Am a Steamdeck user and bought this game for both my Deck and my PS5 so I could play this with my kids.\n\nSo the last week or so has been a little rough - Deck/Linux users have been faced with the inability to do multiplayer and/or access servers.  As of yesterday the developers dropped hot fix 3.1 and that got the Deck users back online and away from the dreaded AVF screen of death.\n\nThat being said - my general review, I am switching back to a thumbs up.  \n\nMy take for Deck users is the game in general handles fairly well.  I completed the campaign prior to this Hotfix (which said it corrected a few additional issues) but playing thru the campaign on the default settings - without tweaking - I only noticed a few major FPS drops.  \n\nThose were at obvious points were you were getting tackled by hordes of bugs and one other place toward the end of the game where you are making a stand against a Chaos incursion.\n\nIn multiplayer, prior to the patch, it played smoothly with other players.  I hadn't seen the disconnect issues a lot of other players have (albeit I have a fiber connection so I don't know if that matters).", "timestamp_created": 1728344907, "timestamp_updated": 1728516430, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.474452555179595947", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "timestamp_dev_responded": 1728480241, "developer_response": "Hello Brother!\n\nWe appreciate the time you take to write this review!\n\nWe just released a hotfix that solves the AVF error on Linux and Steamdeck.\n\nPlease update your game and let us know if the issue persists. Your comments are very important to us and if you change your mind about your review, let us know!", "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "176595115", "author": {"steamid": "76561199249179381", "personaname": "Langewitabang", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199249179381/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 41, "playtime_forever": 788, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 788, "last_played": 1729952904, "avatar": "0f8c5b982f00f4bffbe10b62e5c80de9acebce62"}, "language": "english", "review": "Yeah, forget my last review. this game fell off right after they stopped producing pve missions and focused on its unbalanced and not fun pvp mode. I didn't pay 60 bucks to only get another destiny copy. \nDO NOT BUY", "timestamp_created": 1728344783, "timestamp_updated": 1731733886, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212