376954", "personaname": "ArmedLorax", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/therealqh1/", "num_games_owned": 627, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 61, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 61, "last_played": 1728340260, "avatar": "b5f66435c9c3aede9cd2a3326f1b033abd0af227"}, "language": "english", "review": "game hard crashes and absolutely freezes my PC everytime i go to play it, even switched hard drive installs. not sure whats going on, when i get the 5-10 minutes of playtime i can, the game works great and is a lot of fun. 3080ti. ryzen 7 3800x, 32 gb of RAM plenty of storage space between SSDs and HDDs.\n\nupdate: fixed some issues i thought were being caused by the game, they were not, got to play some more of it and can say its fantastic.", "timestamp_created": 1728340844, "timestamp_updated": 1750519393, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "timestamp_dev_responded": 1728568075, "developer_response": "Hello Brother!\n\nThanks for your review.\n\nTo get rid of this threat and continue to help us against those Tyranids please follow this steps:\n\nPlease update Windows 10 - version must be above 1507\nVerify that the game is launching on correct GPU\nUpdate your GPU driver\nChange the files of the game to ''Disc C''\n\nThe issue you are referring to is our priority, so please be aware of our next updates and open a ticket here: https://support.focus-entmt.com/ so we can investigate a bit more and track you to notify you about the bug being solved.\n\nPlease let us know if the issue persists. Your comments are very important to us and if you change your mind about your review, let us know", "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "176592164", "author": {"steamid": "76561197960320062", "personaname": "starfox.BM", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197960320062/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1200, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 192, "last_played": 1777033181, "avatar": "f4ea2cd6de0c53d2673dda9b265e983c9c628577"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great fun!", "timestamp_created": 1728340488, "timestamp_updated": 1728340488, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "176592136", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970557211", "personaname": "Kazigan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197970557211/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 45, "playtime_forever": 8546, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5452, "last_played": 1739418780, "avatar": "a6cb4f17bc5b031eb2efed3e1dc84a498dd56d87"}, "language": "english", "review": "The issues I had have been fixed. There have been markedly less disconnects and issues since my initial negative review. I've only had one bad load since Oct 17th review (which I still copy paste so those who care can see my initial complaint. Easily over 100 matches since.) \n\n**BUG Noticed*** Why am I having to load into the game once. Press A, continue. Fail to load in. Go back to main menu. Continue again. THEN I'm finally able to actually get a match in pvp mode? If I don't do this is the only work around it I know of.  \n\nInitial review: \nI'm lucky to be able to load into maybe 20% of the co-op missions at this point. I'm regretting my purchase of this game at this point. I'd rather a game be delayed by months than this unplayable ♥♥♥♥. I just wanna game with my buddies and not have my time/money wasted. Honestly this past week 3 of 20 games were able to load in for Co-op.", "timestamp_created": 1728340449, "timestamp_updated": 1732762706, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "176592102", "author": {"steamid": "76561198029941169", "personaname": "IReeces PiecesI", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198029941169/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 14502, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4707, "last_played": 1786996854, "avatar": "1e93416fcfbfefead4397cf4576b2f8879de6a32"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game really fun for both 40k fans and those new to it", "timestamp_created": 1728340404, "timestamp_updated": 1728340404, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "176591746", "author": {"steamid": "76561198067330337", "personaname": "ZeroKool", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198067330337/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 12540, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2643, "last_played": 1775496872, "avatar": "5a71fa3941c783c918f9a3264659233b43cd3f52"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'm using a PC well beyond the system requirements for this game. It crashes 85% of the time and after 44 hours (of recorded play, I have many more trying to run missions) I was just reset to zero... no levels, 